---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Pillars from "../components/Pillars.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/url";
---

<Base
  title="Simon Gibson — Security leadership, now verifying the AI frontier"
  description="25 years building and securing the infrastructure of the modern internet. Bloomberg's first CISO, Gigamon Fellow, running a fleet of AI agents in production and checking whether the frontier's practice matches its paper."
>
  <Hero />

  <hr class="rule wrap" style="max-width: var(--maxw);" />

  <Pillars />

  <hr class="rule wrap" style="max-width: var(--maxw);" />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap thesis">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">The pivot, in one paragraph</p>
        <h2 class="thesis__head">
          The labs are opening their doors to outside verifiers. Someone has
          to know what to look at.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="thesis__body">
        <p>
          The builders of frontier AI have done remarkable work on model-layer
          safety, and this month they committed to something harder: embedded
          third-party evaluators with badges, laptops, and employee-level
          access. What that evaluator has to do is
          <strong>nuts-and-bolts verification</strong> — is the sandbox actually
          enforced, does the monitoring alert reach a human, does the practice
          match the policy on paper.
        </p>
        <p>
          That is the job I have done for 25 years. Bloomberg's first CISO, the
          person who had to answer "are we secure?" to the CEO and mean it.
          Ran large red teams and know exactly how they fail. And I know this
          technology from the inside, because I run a fleet of agents in
          production and I have watched controls rot in real time.
        </p>
        <p class="thesis__kick">
          I don't talk about AI. <strong>I run it — and I know how to check it.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="thesis__cta">
          <a href={withBase("/build")} class="btn solid">What I ship <span class="arr">→</span></a>
          <a href={withBase("/contact")} class="btn">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .thesis {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .thesis__head {
    margin-top: 18px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 92px;
  }
  .thesis__body p {
    color: var(--silver);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .thesis__kick {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.3rem !important;
    color: var(--white) !important;
  }
  .thesis__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .thesis {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .thesis__head {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
